meta {
  name: 07 Change application status
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  X-Dev-User: {{recruiterId}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "status": "SHORTLISTED"
  }
}

docs {
  Fait avancer une candidature. applicationId est capture quand le candidat
  postule (dossier Candidate -> Apply to offer).
  Machine a etats : PENDING -> SHORTLISTED -> APPROVED / REJECTED.
}
